     fix for python3: 2to3 -w -f print .
     remove rosdep update from CMakeLists.txt
     hztest_pr2_image.launch: relax hzerror for caemra test
     add robot_state_publisher to pr2_gazebo/package.xml
   * Contributors: Kei Okada
